{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 75","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_75&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851e9179a19cb7cf6cfae95a24b086deaee7b11f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=\\sqrt{1+\\dfrac1{1^2}+\\dfrac1{2^2}}+\\sqrt{1+\\dfrac1{2^2}+\\dfrac1{3^2}}+\\cdots+\\sqrt{1+\\dfrac1{2007^2}+\\dfrac1{2008^2}}.\\]\" width=\"494\" height=\"43\" /> Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d91b87c3797cb7eb263f15e757c4fa32ed3f79be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor S^2\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"32\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_75&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>With summation notation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac5a85fdb4e88c9799eb288d907bfa9d80e3646c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} \\sqrt{1 + \\tfrac{1}{i^2} + \\tfrac{1}{(i+1)^2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"197\" height=\"55\" />. By using a common denominator and simplifying, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/747e2e23048af7e7479497ce836ce34d16dd3789.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} S &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} \\sqrt{ \\frac{i^2 (i^2 + 2i + 1) + i^2 + 2i + 1 + i^2}{i^2 (i+1)^2} } \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} \\sqrt{ \\frac{i^4 + 2i^3 + 3i^2 + 2i + 1}{i^2 (i+1)^2} } \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} \\sqrt{ \\frac{(i^2 + i + 1)^2}{i^2 (i+1)^2} } \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} \\frac{i^2 + i + 1}{i^2 + i} \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} (1 + \\frac{1}{i(i+1)}) \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{i=1}^{2007} (1 + \\frac{1}{i} - \\frac{1}{i+1}) \\end{align*}\" width=\"338\" height=\"358\" />\n</p><p>Notice that part of the terms telescope, making calculation simpler. Calculation results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b53b7b807cc2b3d955ebc1bfcdedab0f47d6700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 2007 + 1 - \\tfrac{1}{2008}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"155\" height=\"21\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0a1ce816d1d0a4a6f1f6002842688f13f2685df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S^2 = (2008 - \\tfrac{1}{2008})^2 = 4032064 - 2 + (\\tfrac{1}{2008})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"346\" height=\"21\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4d78cec20e8f398fcd207937b9a436c7295401.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; (\\tfrac{1}{2008})^2 &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"117\" height=\"21\" />, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/f/d3fe737658176b2c1ce864d68e8ebe4f1a57098a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor S^2\\rfloor = \\boxed{4032062}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_75&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_74\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 74\">Problem 74</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_76\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 76\">Problem 76</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20